      "id": "claim_8e5f29ded0324719af0de232341b5fdf",
      "statement": "BasePromptTemplate is the abstract base class for all prompt templates, extending RunnableSerializable[dict[str, Any], PromptValue]. It manages input_variables (required), optional_variables (auto-inferred), partial_variables (pre-filled, can be callable), and provides abstract methods format(), format_prompt(), and concrete methods invoke(), ainvoke(), and partial() that implement the runnable protocol.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/core/langchain_core/prompts/base.py#L209-L236",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af77fb9b7969fe83e10a3dc14fb2d3a4af1e1add33fb0f1501b4f3a2d970c10e:"
