    {
      "id": "claim_5f9d2ddb91f948b1baf8f38942cf4d60",
      "statement": "PromptTemplate supports three template formats: f-string (default, using Python's string.Formatter), mustache (with {{variable}} syntax), and jinja2 (full Jinja2 syntax using SandboxedEnvironment by default for security). Format is specified via template_format field and determines how variables are extracted and substituted.",
