      "id": "claim_0d1f8fe7bf08414ab778673adf9d2112",
      "statement": "PromptTemplate provides factory methods from_template() (recommended), from_file(), and from_examples() for construction. from_template() auto-extracts input_variables from the template string and accepts optional template_format and partial_variables parameters.",
