      "id": "claim_5c69594c37ac44a29084f91db659a39d",
      "statement": "ChatPromptTemplate sequences message prompt templates into conversation structures. It auto-infers input_variables from templated messages and optional_variables from optional MessagesPlaceholder instances. Supports tuple shorthand syntax like ('system', template), ('human', template), ('ai', template), and ('placeholder', '{var}') for flexible message specification.",
