      "id": "claim_57b81b9a91b04e0ca56ac78cf08ce848",
      "statement": "ChatPromptTemplate provides format_messages() returning list[BaseMessage], format_prompt() returning ChatPromptValue, and format() returning concatenated string. Single-variable templates auto-wrap non-dict arguments via invoke(). The partial() method returns new instances with pre-filled variables; append(), extend(), and __getitem__() provide in-place and slice-based mutation.",
