      "id": "claim_9005edc4ddd0421da036cf5e70d73a10",
      "statement": "MessagesPlaceholder is a BaseMessagePromptTemplate that accepts a dynamic list of messages at format time. The optional field determines whether the placeholder must be provided (False) or can be omitted returning empty list (True). The n_messages field limits results to the most recent N messages, enabling conversation history truncation.",
