      "statement": "FewShotPromptTemplate formats a prefix, zero or more examples (static from examples field or dynamic from example_selector), and suffix into a single string. The example_prompt field formats each individual example; examples and example_selector are mutually exclusive. Supports only f-string and jinja2 template_format, not mustache.",
