      "statement": "FewShotChatMessagePromptTemplate formats examples as message sequences for chat models. The example_prompt field is a BaseMessagePromptTemplate or BaseChatPromptTemplate that formats each example as a list of messages. Like FewShotPromptTemplate, examples and example_selector are mutually exclusive and input_variables can be passed to the selector.",
