      "id": "claim_acf81fd934ba443fa8a4adccd8c9693e",
      "statement": "PromptValue is the abstract base type returned by all prompt templates (via format_prompt() and invoke()). StringPromptValue wraps a string with to_string() and to_messages() methods; ChatPromptValue wraps a sequence of BaseMessage objects with the same interface. This dual representation enables flexible routing to downstream consumers (chat models, string-based APIs, output parsers).",
