      "statement": "Message prompt template classes (HumanMessagePromptTemplate, AIMessagePromptTemplate, SystemMessagePromptTemplate, ToolMessagePromptTemplate, FunctionMessagePromptTemplate) wrap a StringPromptTemplate and return BaseMessage of the appropriate role. All provide from_template() and from_template_file() factory methods; format() returns a single BaseMessage and format_messages() returns a single-element list.",
